 the creator’s published WebGL build.","src","/GameMap/media/learning/morbreaker-unity-claude.webp","alt","morBreaker gameplay with a paddle, ball, coloured brick grid, and score display.","https://github.com/KingMordas/mor-breaker","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap local capture","list","attribution","创作者记录中的客户端与模型","items",[86],"Claude Code","links","相关资源",[92,93],"resourceIds","section",{"_61":95,"_25":96},{"_61":86,"_25":94},"/zh/resources/claude-code/","Unity · Manual","/zh/resources/unity-engine/","创作者开发记录",[100],"evidence",{"_61":101,"_25":102,"_103":104},"查看 Claude Code 的具体开发分工","https://github.com/KingMordas/mor-breaker#built-with-claude-code-","note","Creator disclosure names the Unity MCP package and lists the editor work Claude performed. It is a process summary, not a published prompt transcript.","源码内容","complete project","项目源码",[109],{"_61":110,"_25":74,"_103":111},"查看完整 Unity 游戏","MIT-licensed Assets, Packages, ProjectSettings, scenes, and C# gameplay source. Requires Unity 6000.4.11f1; open Assets/Scenes/SampleScene.unity and press Play. Windows/WebGL build modules are needed only for packaging; Claude/MCP tooling is not required for play.","获取方式","download","demo","试玩与运行",[117],{"_61":118,"_25":119,"_103":120},"Download morBreaker for Windows or WebGL","https://github.com/KingMordas/mor-breaker/releases/tag/v1.2.0","Version 1.2.0 includes Windows standalone and WebGL ZIPs. Extract the Windows build and launch it, or serve the WebGL build over HTTP. A/D or arrows move, Space launches, H shows scores, and Space/Enter restarts. Pointer/touch controls are included; no public hosted play link is supplied.","游戏平台","GitHub Releases","指南形式","disclosure","tutorial","开发记录与教程",[128],{"_61":129,"_25":102,"_103":-7},"阅读作者的 Unity 与 Claude Code 开发记录","研究这个工作流","ordered",true,[134,135,136,137],"Download the Windows release or serve the published WebGL build over HTTP.","Try paddle steering, acceleration, loss, restart, and the local score list.","Read the creator’s Claude Code disclosure and inspect the gameplay C# scripts.","Open SampleScene.unity with Unity 6000.4.11f1, change one level rule, and test progression.","AI 工作流与开发背景","KingMordas 说明几乎整个游戏由 Claude Code 通过 Unity MCP 插件完成，包括玩法脚本、场景与预制体连接、测试及文档。AI 编辑工具与发布游戏的运行环境相互独立。","aiUse","guidance","创作方式","AI 辅助（创作者归属）","category","provenance","方向","2D","track","metadata","引擎","Unity 6 · URP · C#","engine","lead","2d","ai-assisted",[134,135,136,137],{"_61":168,"_25":102,"_17":124},{"_61":118,"_25":119,"_17":113,"_103":120},{"_61":165,"_25":74,"_166":167,"_103":111},{"_61":164,"_25":102,"_103":104},[162,163],"unity-engine","claude-code","Read the explicit Claude Code contribution breakdown","Open the complete Unity game","scope","complete-project","Read the creator’s Unity and Claude Code account",{"_170":171},"documents",{"_66":172,"_35":173},[175,179,180,181,178,182,183,184,185,186,187,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,177,214,176,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235],[174,175,176,177,178],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","catalog-review-coverage","source-revision-notes","community-case-research","overview","catalog","c